  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nefco DemoUkrainaDH investeringar (2010-2023)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nefco DemoUkrainaDH investments (2010-2023) - DemoUkraina DH Investment Grants (old code)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation between Sida and NEFCO for demonstration of energy        efficiency and environmental improvements in Ukrainian distric        heating utilities. About 10 municipalities will implement projects    supported by Sida, max 3 MSEK per roject, linked to a loan from       NEFCO, max 400 000 Euro.Sida support,30 MSEK, will enable investments of 8-10 MEuro, annual emissions reductions of 40 000-50 000 ton CO2.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete mellan Sida och NEFCO f&#xf6;r demonstrationsprojekt  f&#xf6;r        milj&#xf6;f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar och energieffektivisering  i ukrainska             fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rmebolag. Ca 10 kommuner kommer genomf&#xf6;ra projekt med st&#xf6;d     fr&#xe5;n Sida, max 3 MSEK per projekt l&#xe4;nkat till l&#xe5;n fr&#xe5;n NEFCO, max 400 000 Euro.Sidas st&#xf6;d,30 MSEK, m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r investeringar om 8-10 MEuro,   &#xe5;rliga utsl&#xe4;ppsminskningar 40 000-50 000 ton CO2.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DemoUkrainaDH programme was established in 2011 in cooperation between NEFCO, Sida and the Ministry for Regional Development, Housing, Construction and Municipal Services of Ukraine (Minregion) with the objective to implement demonstration projects for modern and energy efficient district heating in Ukraine. Initially the target was to implement 10 demonstration projects in different Ukrainian cities. In 2013 the programme was extended to include intotal 20 demonstration projects.</narrative>
  </description>
